# The /zigprogress admin command family AND the progression admin page: help text, listings and answers.
# The file name is the key PREFIX: an entry here resolves as ziggfreedcommon.progression.admin.<key>.
# The desc.* keys are what the engine's own help resolves a command or an argument through; the
# page.* keys are the admin page's own lines.

desc.family = Inspect and administer this server's quests, achievements and dialogue memories.
desc.reload = Fold the shared quest and achievement assets again and publish them.
desc.quest = Quests: the catalogue, one player's log, and the admin moves on it.
desc.quest.list = List every quest in the shared catalogue.
desc.quest.give = Start a quest for a player, whether or not they qualify.
desc.quest.reset = Wipe a player's record of one quest, or of every quest.
desc.quest.complete = Close a quest out for a player and pay it.
desc.quest.status = Show where every quest stands for one player.
desc.quest.accept = Take a quest on, if the player qualifies.
desc.quest.claim = Collect a finished quest's rewards.
desc.quest.abandon = Give up a quest the player is carrying.
desc.achievement = Achievements: the catalogue, one player's record, and the admin moves on it.
desc.achievement.list = List every achievement in the shared catalogue.
desc.achievement.status = Show where every achievement stands for one player.
desc.achievement.give = Earn an achievement for a player, whether or not its criteria are met.
desc.achievement.claim = Collect an earned achievement's waiting rewards.
desc.achievement.reset = Wipe a player's record of one achievement, or of every achievement.
desc.memory = Dialogue memories: what conversations remember about a player.
desc.memory.forget = Forget everything every conversation remembers about a player.
desc.arg.player = The player to act on. Defaults to you.
desc.arg.quest = The quest id.
desc.arg.quest_or_all = A quest id, or 'all'.
desc.arg.quest_filter = Show only this quest.
desc.arg.achievement = The achievement id.
desc.arg.achievement_or_all = An achievement id, or 'all'.
desc.arg.achievement_filter = Show only this achievement.
desc.arg.tag = Show only content carrying this tag.
desc.arg.everyone = Every player online, in every world.

